[1m[38;5;231mWhich tooling should the design set up, given the repo currently has none?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Unit tests via node:test (Recommended)
  [38;5;246mBuilt into Node, zero dependencies, keeps package.json dependency-free. Adds a "test": "node --test" script and a [39m
  [38;5;246mfirst passing test for the prefs module.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Linter + formatter
