  [38;5;246mreformat the existing files.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright driving the real page to confirm the preference survives a reload. Strongest proof the feature works; [39m
  [38;5;246mheaviest dependency by far.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] None — no tooling
